# Extension signing key. wxt.config.ts derives manifest.key from it at build time to pin
# the extension ID, so no key material is committed -- public or private. This is the only
# copy of that identity: losing it forces a new key, hence a new ID, which resets every
# user's stored settings. Back it up outside the repo. See docs/RELEASING.md.
key.pem
*.pem

